      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOVEREIGN REIGN (6) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Scored by 5 lengths last time (19.93) in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. Looks well placed and should feature. SAVE TIME (8) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 20.07 beating Miss Tess. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Sure to be thereabouts. LUMEAH MONTE (7) doesn't win out of turn. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (20.44) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Can feature again. PURE BLUE (2) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
